[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10442.71, "timestamp": "02:54:02", "text": "名前をここに表示して、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10444.71, "timestamp": "02:54:04", "text": "待って、この側はどうする？どうするのが一番"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10448.469, "timestamp": "02:54:08", "text": "いいか分からない。どう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10452.469, "timestamp": "02:54:12", "text": "参照すればいいかな？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10458.309, "timestamp": "02:54:18", "text": "YouTube Music がやっているように、こうすればいいと思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10460.79, "timestamp": "02:54:20", "text": "曲名をここに、この"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10463.51, "timestamp": "02:54:23", "text": "下に表示して、ここには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10466.389, "timestamp": "02:54:26", "text": "空きスペースを作る。 まあ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10469.11, "timestamp": "02:54:29", "text": "大丈夫だと思います。 それで、曲名と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10471.03, "timestamp": "02:54:31", "text": "この"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10473.19, "timestamp": "02:54:33", "text": "H。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10476.389, "timestamp": "02:54:36", "text": "ええと、そうするしかないですね。 いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10478.15, "timestamp": "02:54:38", "text": "つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10480.95, "timestamp": "02:54:40", "text": "Notionの設定をすれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10483.91, "timestamp": "02:54:43", "text": "Sammy関連のものも動作するようになります。  「わからない」と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10491.269, "timestamp": "02:54:51", "text": "。 アイデアは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10492.79, "timestamp": "02:54:52", "text": "人生を変える力を持っている。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10497.75, "timestamp": "02:54:57", "text": "AIAが来た。私は「やらなきゃいけない」と思った。"}]